## Acceptance checks

- A separate print URL exists if advertised.
- Print output contains the title, relevant dates and units.
- No essential information depends on a background colour.
- Hidden interactive controls do not leave unexplained gaps.

Check the examples at narrow widths, with a keyboard and without JavaScript. Test a production implementation against its actual data and permissions before calling it supported.

